It sounds like this is about him, and not about you. The fact that he actually did integrate your comment points to the fact that his outburst was just his gut instinct to dealing with a hurdle, and not a reflection of the value of your feedback. Perhaps he is stressed out in his position, and has not learned to manage his anger in a healthy way.

&amp;#x200B;

And nobody likes to be spoken to like that. Our jobs are already difficult without hostility from co-workers. I would be upset too if I was just trying to do my job, and someone lashed out their frustrations at me.
